config BR2_PACKAGE_EDGESIGHT_MODELS
	bool "edgesight-models"
	help
	  Pre-trained COCO object-detection models (hash-pinned) and a
	  small set of sample frames used for the boot-time self-test
	  and offline demo:
	   - SSD-MobileNet-v1 ONNX FP32 and INT8 (ONNX Model Zoo, Apache-2.0)
	   - SSD-MobileNet-v1 TFLite uint8 quantised (TensorFlow, Apache-2.0)
	   - COCO val2017 sample images (CC-BY 4.0)

	  Deliberately NOT YOLOv5/v8 (AGPL-3.0) to keep the image free of
	  copyleft obligations on the application.
